  ok: GN-STRING GN-BUF 1 ;
  ok: GN-CONSUMED GN-BUF CHAR+ 0 ;
  ok: GN' [CHAR] ' WORD CHAR+ C@ GN-BUF C! GN-STRING ;
  okT{ 0 0 GN' 0' >NUMBER -> 0 0 GN-CONSUMED }T  Actual:Expected 0 =?= 0 781A =?= 781A 0 =?= 0 0 =?= 0 
  okT{ 0 0 GN' 1' >NUMBER -> 1 0 GN-CONSUMED }T  Actual:Expected 0 =?= 0 781A =?= 781A 0 =?= 0 1 =?= 1 
  okT{ 1 0 GN' 1' >NUMBER -> BASE @ 1+ 0 GN-CONSUMED }T  Actual:Expected 0 =?= 0 781A =?= 781A 0 =?= 0 11 =?= 11 
  ok\ FOLLOWING SHOULD FAIL TO CONVERT
  ok\ BUG FIX: these three tests used to be glued onto the end of this
